#ASSERT NOT `proceedings for the failure are barred` `an act required by a contract` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `proceedings for the failure are barred` `an act under a written law` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `proceedings for the failure are barred` `a duty of care in tort` FALSE

§ `s 4`

